{
  "version": 1,
  "title": {
    "en": "ESP32 DevKit across two breadboards",
    "es": "ESP32 DevKit sobre dos protoboards"
  },
  "board": "double",
  "clearance": 1,
  "description": {
    "en": "An ESP32 DevKit with nets on both pin headers: on one breadboard it would cover a whole strip of one header, so layout put it on two boards side by side (board double), across the joint, with a free strip under each header. D4 lights the LED, D15 reads the button, D34 the potentiometer.",
    "es": "Un ESP32 DevKit con redes en las dos filas de pines: en una sola protoboard taparía toda una tira de una de ellas, así que layout lo puso en dos protoboards lado a lado (board double), sobre la unión, con una tira libre bajo cada fila de pines. D4 enciende el LED, D15 lee el pulsador y D34 el potenciómetro."
  },
  "netLabels": {
    "B-": "GND",
    "U-": "GND"
  },
